-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 2, §2.5 גננת מאמנת
-- A training (coaching) kindergarten teacher is entitled to the training
-- allowance, whose terms are in section 1.12.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT vocabulary

§ `2.5 גננת מאמנת`

§§ `2.5.6 Training allowance`
    @ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_5__ssec_2_5_6/p2
    GIVEN `the training allowance of section 1.12` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER @desc The training allowance (גמול אימון) of section 1.12 for the employee's salary, an input until section 1.12 is imported

@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_5__ssec_2_5_6/p1
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the training allowance under 2.5.6` p IF
    p EQUALS `a training kindergarten teacher`

-- The allowance's amount and terms are section 1.12's: a named input until
-- that section is imported.

#ASSERT `entitled to the training allowance under 2.5.6` `a training kindergarten teacher`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD NOT `entitled to the training allowance under 2.5.6` p) (filter (GIVEN p YIELD NOT p EQUALS `a training kindergarten teacher`) `every kindergarten post`)
